<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Bio-Inspired Technologies Gallery</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f5f5f5;
    --card-bg: #fff;
    --text: #222;
    --primary: #005c97;
    --accent: #363795;
    --shadow: rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  }
  .dark {
    --bg: #0e0f10;
    --card-bg: #1b1d1f;
    --text: #f3f3f3;
    --primary: #4fa3ff;
    --accent: #222;
    --shadow: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }

  * {box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0;}
  body {background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; transition: 0.3s;}
  header {background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent)); color: white; text-align:center; padding:35px 10px; font-size:2rem; font-weight:bold; position:relative;}
  .toggle-btn {position:absolute; top:20px; right:25px; background:white; border:none; border-radius:25px; padding:8px 15px; cursor:pointer; font-weight:bold; color:#333; transition:0.3s;}
  .dark .toggle-btn {background:#222; color:white;}
  .toggle-btn:hover {transform: scale(1.08);}
  .subtitle {text-align:center; margin-top: -10px; font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--text);}
  .container {display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap:25px; padding: 20px;}
  .card {background: var(--card-bg); border-radius:14px; box-shadow:0 4px 20px var(--shadow); padding:20px; transition:0.3s; border: 2px solid transparent; cursor:pointer;}
  .card:hover {transform: translateY(-5px); border-color: var(--primary);}
  .card img {width:100%; height:180px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:10px; margin-bottom:15px; transition: transform 0.4s;}
  .card:hover img {transform: scale(1.05);}
  h3 {color: var(--primary); margin-bottom:10px;}
  p {line-height:1.5; font-size:0.95rem;}
  footer {text-align:center; padding:20px; background: var(--primary); color:white; margin-top:40px; font-size:1rem;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  Bio-Inspired Technologies Gallery
  <button class="toggle-btn" onclick="toggleMode()">🌙 Dark Mode</button>
</header>

<p class="subtitle">Discover engineering innovations inspired by nature</p>

<div class="container" id="gallery">
  <div class="card">
    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Gecko_feet.jpg/640px-Gecko_feet.jpg" alt="Gecko Feet">
    <h3>Gecko Feet → Smart Adhesives</h3>
    <p>Microscopic hairs create strong but reversible adhesion. Engineers use this in robotic grippers and climbing pads.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Shark_skin_closeup.JPG/640px-Shark_skin_closeup.JPG" alt="Shark Skin">
    <h3>Shark Skin → Anti-Bacterial Surfaces</h3>
    <p>Shark skin textures reduce drag and prevent bacterial growth. Used in swimsuits, hospital coatings, and aircraft surfaces.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Lotus_leaf.jpg/640px-Lotus_leaf.jpg" alt="Lotus Leaf">
    <h3>Lotus Leaf → Self-Cleaning Coatings</h3>
    <p>Waxy, bumpy surfaces repel water and dirt. Inspires self-cleaning paints, solar panels, and fabrics.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Owl_wings.jpg/640px-Owl_wings.jpg" alt="Owl Wings">
    <h3>Owl Wings → Silent Fans</h3>
    <p>Serrated wing edges reduce noise. Applied in drones, fans, and wind turbines for quiet operation.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Termite_mound.jpg/640px-Termite_mound.jpg" alt="Termite Mounds">
    <h3>Termite Mounds → Natural Cooling</h3>
    <p>Airflow channels maintain temperature. Used in sustainable architecture for passive cooling without AC.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>Science Expo Project • Bio-Inspired Engineering</footer>

<script>
function toggleMode(){
  document.body.classList.toggle("dark");
  const btn = document.querySelector(".toggle-btn");
  if(document.body.classList.contains("dark")){
    btn.textContent="☀️ Light Mode";
  } else { btn.textContent="🌙 Dark Mode"; }
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
